abstract: "Uroboros Knowledge Engine (Neuro Alexander) is an enterprise-grade, zero-dependency, single-node knowledge management, semantic retrieval, and document intelligence platform featuring 21 RAG innovation pillars, 134 domain intelligence modules, SQLite FTS5 vector storage, and an air-gapped React 19 single-page application."
